{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜藤嶌果歩(19)です🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Kind of love」\nMV皆さん観てくれていますか！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVを観てもっとこの曲が好きになったよって方もたくさんいるはず！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もその1人です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "センターのポジションを頂き、この曲と向き合っては悩んでを繰り返してきましたがこのMVを初めて観た時に思わず涙が出ました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっつも悔し涙ばっかりだったから感動して涙が出たのがすごく久しぶりで自分でもびっくりしたのを覚えています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんな自分の話、誰に質問されてる訳でもないのにペラペラと！なんかちょっぴり恥ずかしいのですが！まあブログなので許してくださいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂の中でもまた新しいジャンルの楽曲だったので、情熱的なこの曲を私が表現し切れるのか、このシングルを盛り上げていけるのかなぁと不安に思っていた気持ちは\nこのMVを見てワクワクに変わり\nこれからの日向坂に対する期待が膨らみ感動のあまり涙が出ました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな素敵なMVです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↓ぜひ♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/W5AGk8Cc7zg?si=oXex0TYQjrBX442s"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobYxcVxJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobhtfsAn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "似たような写真だけどカメラが違うんです！\n選べないからどっちも載せちゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobtFBYCA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花柄の衣装もとっても可愛いですよね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVの中にはお花がふんだんに使われております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "0サビは綿毛が飛んでる中で撮影したのでふわふわしてて可愛い！そしてみんな表情はかっこいい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がMV中ずーっと持っているお花は「アネモネ」です💜\n花言葉は諸説ありですが\n「あなたを信じて待つ」\n「はかない恋」などなど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見応えがありすぎるMVなのでたくさん考察して欲しい気持ちです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobaYuFSW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobrg48LD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回のMVテーマは「一目惚れの瞬間」\n少女から大人の女性になる姿が世界観のポイントです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなが各自のお花と妖艶に映ってるワンシーンで私だけアネモネ持ってピュアな表情なんです！\n(0:36とかね)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてこの白黒衣装の時はメンバーみんな左手の薬指が青くなっている中、最初は私だけ青く染まっておらず1C前のシーンで円になり私の指が青に染まる儀式が行われました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それを大人になるための儀式だと捉えて、大人になることへの期待も不安も喜びも感じながら撮影をしていました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "顔に塗料を付けるシーンは付けても良いし付けなくても良いというお話だったのですがガッツリ付ける選択をしました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうですか！MVもっかい観たくなりましたか🎹\n何回でも観てくださいね〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobuOtEel.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "左手の薬指が隠れているので\n少女なのか、大人なのか、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポーズはまだまだ子どもっぽい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして「Kind of love」を\n5月15日放送の MUSICSTATION さんで\n初披露させて頂くことが決定しましたⓂ️💖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "記念すべき初披露を大舞台で！！\nとっても嬉しいです(T^T)\nこの素敵な楽曲がたくさんの方に届きますように..！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして\n5月18日の CDTVライブ!ライブ! さんに\n生出演させて頂きます✨️✨️\n2時間スペシャルに登場です！\nこちらも是非楽しみにしていてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ17thシングル盛り上げていきたいのでこれからもよろしくお願いします☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobS7iAfD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこの辺で〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卵焼きをバターたっぷりで作るのにハマってます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなは甘め派？しょっぱい派？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "火曜日もおつかれさまです🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "藤嶌果歩"}], "source": "official"}